    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i7-9700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon VII / Nvidia GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 75 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The \u201cPerformance mode\u201d game setting enables gameplay at 1080p/60fps.1080p/30fps gameplay is possible with the AMD Ryzen 3 3100, 3.40 GHZ or the Intel Core i3-8100, 3.60 GHz CPUs and the AMD Radeon RX 590, Intel Arc A580 or Nvidia GeForce GTX 980 GPUs.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800X / Intel Core i7-12700KF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT / Nvidia GeForce RTX 2080 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 75 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> *SSD is required. The &quot;Balanced mode&quot; game setting enables gameplay at 1080p/60fps. Windows 10 (Version 1809 or later) and a GPU (graphics board/video card) with at least 4GB of VRAM are required to enable the DirectX 12 API. To play at 1080p/60fps in the \u201cQuality mode\u201d game setting, the AMD Ryzen 7 7700X or the Intel Core i7-12700KF CPUs and the AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT or Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 Ti GPUs are recommended.</li></ul>"
